  Hi #{@user.username},

  This is a final reminder that Nitrous Lite will be shut down completely on July 15, 2015.

  You have #{@boxes.size} remaining #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} on Nitrous Lite: #{@boxes.to_sentence}

  The above #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} will be terminated and no longer be available upon the shutdown of Nitrous Lite.

  To assist with the transition, we're offering a limited-time 50% discount on Nitrous Pro plans for the first month. Make sure to claim the coupon before it expires on July 18th!

  [@@@FIXME COUPON LINK]()

  We believe strongly in data portability, so we have provided two ways to preserve your data:

  1. (Recommended) Migrate your #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} to a new account on Nitrous Pro. You can find a migration guide at [https://community.nitrous.io/docs/migrate-your-box-from-nitrous-lite-to-nitrous-pro](https://community.nitrous.io/docs/migrate-your-box-from-nitrous-lite-to-nitrous-pro).

  2. If you only wish to backup your data without a new account, you can find a guide on doing so at [https://community.nitrous.io/docs/backing-up-your-nitrous-lite-data](https://community.nitrous.io/docs/backing-up-your-nitrous-lite-data).

  If you have any questions or need any help at all, please get in touch at [support@nitrous.io](mailto:support@nitrous.io). We hope to see you on [Nitrous Pro](https://pro.nitrous.io) soon!

  Cheers,<br>
  The Nitrous Team
